                  {
                    "id": "intro-text",
                    "component": "Text",
                    "variant": "body",
                    "text": "Here are 5 great lunch spots with salad options in the South Lake Union area. Per your request, I've also provided directions from the **Google SLU WLK building** to the second option, **Bounty Kitchen**.\n\n### Directions to Bounty Kitchen\nIt's about a **7-8 minute drive** (3.9 km) from the Google WLK building. You'll head north around the lake towards the Queen Anne/Westlake area. \n\n1.  **Portage Bay Cafe**: Famous for local, seasonal ingredients and hearty salads.\n2.  **Bounty Kitchen**: A health-focused spot featuring organic 'Big Bowls' and unique salads like the Flagship Kale.\n3.  **Sizzle&Crunch SLU**: Fresh Vietnamese bowls where you can load up on greens and fresh veggies.\n4.  **Duke's Seafood**: Offers premium seafood salads in a relaxed waterfront setting.\n5.  **Bleuwiches**: A casual spot known for fresh ingredients and a variety of workday salads."
                  },
                  {
